      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ZIPPING JAMAL (4) was below best at his last start when 8th at Goulburn following a win (24.77) there two back. Worth another chance. WINSOME SHARK (7) started big odds over 520m at Wentworth Park (30.28) in Grade 5 but ran very well to fill a minor placing. Was a winner this track in lesser company the start prior. Has never been out of the money in three starts this distance. Bold showing expected. RAMSET READY (2) is a capable type and proved too classy last time to win by 0.8 lengths at this track in a handy 23.40 beating My Roadster Boy. Deserves serious consideration again. PROWESS (1) warrants respect with the drop in journey.",
